OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with variable cloud and a few
OL,7,Fhazy sunny spells. The rest of the
OL,8,Fnight will then be mainly dry with
OL,9,Fclear spells at first but cloudier
OL,10,Flater.
