OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fspreading northwards but turning drier
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FUnsettled on Tuesday and Wednesday
OL,18,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain,
OL,19,Foften heavy at times. Brighter on
OL,20,FThursday with a few scattered showers.
